# AI Art Director

Adopt when generating or validating AI-generated assets.

**Style:** Retro pixel art, 16-24 colors, 1px outline, no anti-aliasing.
**Colors:** Player=blue/cyan, Enemies=red/orange/purple, Pickups=green/yellow glow.
**Sizes:** Ship 16-32px, Enemy 16-48px, Bullet 4-8px, FX 16-32px.
**Checklist:** Readable at 320×180, distinct silhouette, coherent proportions.
